      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}0.\\dot{7}&=0.777777\\ldots\\\\&=0.7+0.07+0.007+\\cdots\\end{align*}$$\nThis is a GP with $a=0.7$ and $r=0.1$.\n$$0.\\dot{7}=S_\\infty=\\frac{0.7}{1-0.1}=\\frac{7}{9}.$$",
